[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative\nterminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753196\">7040B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the parkign sensor speaker.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor speaker</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>P44</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the fixing bolts (2a) and remove the parking sensor speaker.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064853.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the parking sensor speaker\nin place and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nparking sensor speaker.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor speaker</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>P44</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753196\">7040B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]